  "CharacterDescription": "Denis Bar Emmon is the Lord of Sharp Point and head of House Bar Emmon - a small but strategically placed fortification on the coast of Crackclaw Point east of King's Landing. The Bar Emmons guard access to the Narrow Sea in a way larger houses have noticed. Denis is a young lord, possibly still a youth, managing a lordship he may have inherited before he was ready. Sharp Point sits between the Crownlands and the waters beyond, which makes it interesting to anyone who needs to move ships in or out of King's Landing without being seen.",
